# cbld package index
#
# The live format is TOML overlay recipes: see cbld-libs.toml in this
# directory. This file is the legacy `shorthand <url>` shape; it is still
# accepted by `cbld sync` and `~/.cbld/cbld-libs`.
#
# Overlay recipes ship inside the cbld binary. `cbld sync` is only needed to
# add or override entries.
#
# Example (legacy):
# gh:iamvxrn/foo https://github.com/iamvxrn/foo.git
